    <briefdescription>
<para>This class simplifies the development of queries on the AST resulting in a list of AST nodes.</para><para>This class used several member function within it&apos;s interface. Each member function takes an AST node pointer (any subtree of the AST). This class represents a library of queries.. Basically it will support a large number of different types of queries that can be ask of an AST and that return a list of SgNode pointers. </para>    </briefdescription>
